
load @term/seed/code/proof/equal
  find equal

rule transitivity
  head a
  take x, like a
  take y, like a
  take z, like a
  take left
    like equal a x y
  take right
    like equal a y z
  like equal a x z

test transitivity
  take x, like a
  take y, like a
  take z, like a
  take left
    like equal a x y
  take right
    like equal a y z
  fork case, read left
    case refl
      fork case, read right
        case refl
          send back
            make equal/refl
